		{"id":"g-risks","type":"group","x":2960,"y":3760,"width":5400,"height":480,"color":"1","label":"Open Questions & Balance Risks"},
		{"id":"g-perks","type":"group","x":2600,"y":-100,"width":1400,"height":1500,"color":"6","label":"Perks (drafted in-run, reset per session)"},
		{"id":"g-ui","type":"group","x":5660,"y":0,"width":1400,"height":1500,"label":"UI / UX"},
		{"id":"g-quests","type":"group","x":-1840,"y":-100,"width":1240,"height":1500,"label":"Quests"},
		{"id":"g-board","type":"group","x":1200,"y":-100,"width":1200,"height":1500,"label":"Board & Tiles"},
		{"id":"g-loop","type":"group","x":0,"y":-100,"width":1000,"height":1500,"color":"5","label":"Core Loop"},
		{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# Puzzles of the Forest: GDD Map\nHex tile-placement puzzle · roguelite-lite · premium Steam (~15 PLN)\n\n**Legend:** grey = embedded GDD section (live) · cyan = core loop · green = done/stable · orange = in progress · red = open decision / risk","x":0,"y":-1180,"width":1000,"height":200},
		{"id":"f1","type":"text","text":"**Main Menu**\nPLAY · HOW TO PLAY · QUIT","x":60,"y":-40,"width":400,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f2","type":"text","text":"**Session start**\n30-tile deck + free center tile\nSessionStart perks · quests reset","x":60,"y":140,"width":400,"height":130,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f4","type":"text","text":"**Place or Reroll**\nany empty hex adjacent to board\nhover preview: grey / yellow / green","x":60,"y":540,"width":400,"height":130,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f5","type":"text","text":"**Automatic evaluation**\nhabitat classifier (§7.2)\n+ same-biome group bonus (§7.5)","x":60,"y":750,"width":400,"height":130,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f6","type":"text","text":"**Habitat formed**\n+100 pts · +3 deck tiles\nquest progress · merge check","x":60,"y":960,"width":400,"height":130,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f7","type":"text","text":"**Perk draft**\npick 1 of 3","x":560,"y":960,"width":380,"height":110,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"t-loopnote","type":"text","text":"Only loss condition: deck runs out.\nGood play **buys more turns** (+3 tiles per habitat, quest rewards), and there's no hard cap.","x":60,"y":1180,"width":880,"height":160},
		{"id":"t-recipes","type":"text","text":"## Animal recipes\n(Meadow, Forest, Bush, Rock, Water)\n\n| Animal | Recipe |\n|---|---|\n| 🐝 Bees | 2 · 1 · 2 · 0 · 0 |\n| 🦫 Beaver | 0 · 2 · 1 · 0 · 2 |\n| 🦌 Deer | 2 · 1 · 1 · 0 · 1 |\n| 🐻 Bear | 0 · 1 · 1 · 2 · 1 |\n\nEach sums to 5 → exact 5-tile match, **100 pts** each.","x":-1360,"y":1650,"width":600,"height":560},
		{"id":"t-ranking","type":"text","text":"## Score sources, biggest first\n1. **Merging** (same animal, adjacent): 2 habitats → **500** for 10 tiles (2.5×)\n2. **Same-biome group**: 10 × group size per placement (grows quadratically)\n3. **Single habitat**: flat 100\n4. Perk score mods: hook exists, **unused**","x":-1360,"y":2240,"width":600,"height":820,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s-classify","type":"file","file":"docs/GDD.md","subpath":"#7.2 Region discovery (automatic, every placement)","x":-720,"y":1650,"width":780,"height":700},
		{"id":"s-pitch","type":"file","file":"docs/GDD.md","subpath":"#1. Elevator Pitch","x":-1360,"y":-870,"width":800,"height":600},
		{"id":"s-status","type":"file","file":"docs/GDD.md","subpath":"#2. Current Status","x":-520,"y":-870,"width":800,"height":600},
		{"id":"t-numbers","type":"text","text":"## At a glance\n- **30** tile deck (+1 free center tile)\n- **5** biomes: Meadow · Forest · Bush · Rock · Water\n- **4** animals: Bees · Beaver · Deer · Bear\n- **11** perks (draft every 5th habitat)\n- **8** main + **10** side quests\n- **3** rerolls / session, **3** draft rerolls / run\n- Every habitat = exactly **5 tiles**, **100 pts**","x":320,"y":-870,"width":700,"height":600,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"s-nongoals","type":"file","file":"docs/GDD.md","subpath":"#12. Explicit non-goals (per current scope)","x":1060,"y":-870,"width":1300,"height":600},
		{"id":"t-perk-world","type":"text","text":"## World mutation\n- **Beaver Dam**: Beaver habitat → spawn adjacent Water tile\n- **Expansion**: 30% on habitat → spawn random adjacent tile","x":3320,"y":-60,"width":640,"height":380,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"t-perk-hooks","type":"text","text":"## Hooks\nSessionStart · HabitatAssigned · RerollCost · TilePlaced · **HabitatEvaluation** (unused) · DeckPoolWeight\n\nPerks emit **commands** (AddRerolls, SpawnTile, AddDeckTiles), not direct mutations.","x":3320,"y":350,"width":640,"height":320},
		{"id":"r1","type":"text","text":"## 1. Perk pass\n11 perks. Scoring perks were tried and cut; that design space is still open.","x":4240,"y":-60,"width":600,"height":260,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"r2","type":"text","text":"## 2. RockDweller cleanup\n✅ Done: matrix trimmed to 4 animals.","x":4880,"y":-60,"width":580,"height":260,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"r3","type":"text","text":"## 3. Steam packaging\nStore page · achievements (none, no persistent stats) · credits · resolution & key-rebinding screens","x":4240,"y":240,"width":600,"height":340,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"s-biomes","type":"file","file":"docs/GDD.md","subpath":"#6.2 Biomes","x":1820,"y":-60,"width":560,"height":300},
		{"id":"s-ext","type":"file","file":"docs/GDD.md","subpath":"#6.4 Session-extension tiles","x":1820,"y":270,"width":560,"height":620},
		{"id":"t-perk-econ","type":"text","text":"## Economy\n- **Seed Bank**: +5 deck tiles at start\n- **Mulligan**: +2 rerolls\n- **Biodiversity**: habitat spanning ≥4 biomes → +1 tile\n- **Patient Forager**: each habitat → free reroll charge","x":2640,"y":-60,"width":640,"height":380,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"t-perk-aff","type":"text","text":"## Deck bias (5×)\n**Meadow / Forest / Bush / Rock / Water Affinity**\n+3 copies of favored biome in the draw pool (~4× as likely). Affects initial deck, rerolls, and rewards.","x":2640,"y":350,"width":640,"height":320,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"s-perks","type":"file","file":"docs/GDD.md","subpath":"#8.1 The eleven current perks","x":2640,"y":700,"width":1320,"height":660},
		{"id":"r4","type":"text","text":"## 4. Replayability decision\nEvery session is the same apart from RNG. Solitaire-style replay, or add a hook? **Decide explicitly.**","x":4880,"y":240,"width":580,"height":340,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"r5","type":"text","text":"## 5. Water shader (paused)\n- `_WaterDepth` too high (10) → try 0.3–1\n- Foam noise uses per-tile UV → feed world-space XZ into `Movement`","x":4240,"y":620,"width":1220,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"s-steam","type":"file","file":"docs/GDD.md","subpath":"#11. What \"finished and polished for Steam\" likely means from here","x":4240,"y":960,"width":1220,"height":960},
		{"id":"s-grid","type":"file","file":"docs/GDD.md","subpath":"#6.1 Grid","x":1240,"y":-60,"width":560,"height":300},
		{"id":"s-deck","type":"file","file":"docs/GDD.md","subpath":"#6.3 Deck & Draw","x":1240,"y":270,"width":560,"height":620},
		{"id":"s-controls","type":"file","file":"docs/GDD.md","subpath":"#5. Controls & Camera","x":1240,"y":920,"width":1140,"height":440},
		{"id":"s-scoresum","type":"file","file":"docs/GDD.md","subpath":"#7.6 Scoring summary","x":100,"y":2400,"width":940,"height":660},
		{"id":"t-compatnote","type":"text","text":"Compatibility matrix is **unused**: kept as data for a future perk pass.","x":1740,"y":2400,"width":620,"height":200},
		{"id":"s-quests","type":"file","file":"docs/GDD.md","subpath":"#9. Quests","x":-1760,"y":-40,"width":1080,"height":690},
		{"id":"k1","type":"text","text":"**Group bonus × Water Affinity**: is a big single-biome \"farm\" a fun alternate playstyle or degenerate? Tune `pointsPerGroupTile`.","x":3000,"y":3810,"width":1000,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"k2","type":"text","text":"**Affinity stacking**: several Affinities dilute the other biomes. Cap them, or make them mutually exclusive in the draft?","x":4040,"y":3810,"width":1000,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"k3","type":"text","text":"**Perk variety**: no perks use `HabitatEvaluation`, and there are no risk/reward drawback perks.","x":5080,"y":3810,"width":1000,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"k4","type":"text","text":"**Merging dominates scoring** (2.5×). Tune it before anything else.","x":6120,"y":3810,"width":1000,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"k5","type":"text","text":"**No hard cap on run length**: a very efficient run could go on indefinitely.","x":7160,"y":3810,"width":1160,"height":200,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"k6","type":"text","text":"Tie-break quirk: Deer wins leftover ties (enum order). Rarely fires.","x":3000,"y":4040,"width":1000,"height":150},
		{"id":"t-uinote","type":"text","text":"⚠️ UI is built **procedurally** with scene `*View` overrides. Check what's wired in the scene before restyling.","x":5700,"y":1080,"width":1320,"height":380,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"s-ui","type":"file","file":"docs/GDD.md","subpath":"#10. UI/UX Surfaces (implemented)","x":5700,"y":50,"width":1320,"height":1000},
		{"id":"s-compat","type":"file","file":"docs/GDD.md","subpath":"#7.3 Compatibility (scoring flavor only, not tile-sharing)","x":100,"y":1650,"width":620,"height":700},
		{"id":"s-group","type":"file","file":"docs/GDD.md","subpath":"#7.5 Same-biome group bonus (base mechanic, always on)","x":750,"y":1650,"width":780,"height":700},
		{"id":"s-merge","type":"file","file":"docs/GDD.md","subpath":"#7.4 Merging","x":1580,"y":1650,"width":780,"height":700},
		{"id":"t-tension","type":"text","text":"## ⚖️ Core design tension\n**Habitats** need a *mixed*-biome region\n↕\n**Group bonus** rewards clustering the *same* biome\n\nThis is the main decision on every placement.","x":260,"y":2400,"width":780,"height":660,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"f8","type":"text","text":"**Deck empty → Game Over**\nscore · habitats · largest habitat","x":660,"y":350,"width":300,"height":110,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f3","type":"text","text":"**Draw next tile**\nHUD: icon · name · queue length","x":90,"y":350,"width":340,"height":110,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"f9","type":"text","text":"**RESTART** / MAIN MENU","x":580,"y":165,"width":380,"height":80,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"t-sideq","type":"text","text":"## Side quests (10)\n\"Create **N** habitats of <animal>\"\n\n→ rewards: rerolls, deck cards, points, biome tiles\n(Beaver → Water, Bear → Rocks / +1000)","x":-1760,"y":715,"width":440,"height":300,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"t-mainq","type":"text","text":"## Main quests (8)\n\"Build a <animal> habitat with **10+ / 15+** tiles\"\n\n→ only reachable via **merging**\n→ reward: **pick 1 of 3 perks**","x":-1120,"y":715,"width":440,"height":300,"color":"6"}
	],
